<title>EGYPT: Egyptian treasury offers 91-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Egyptian treasury offers 91-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 91-day treasury bills worth 900 million pounds for auction on May 14 and issue on May 15 when 91-day bills worth 603.775 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.480 percent.</p>
<p>$1= 3.395 pounds</p>
</text>
